<p>I often see SCP-XXXX-1 and it doesn't seem entirely clear as to what this is used for, I see it used to designate objects that come from or exist in an SCP such as SCP-3008-1 but if I recall correctly I believe I remember sing it as an event or a title describing somethings anomalous properties. so what exactly is this for? additionally I'm wondering if something like SCP-XXXX-1-1 would be acceptable or if it should just be referred to as SCP-XXXX-2. I have no specific ideas that would entail using the SCP-XXXX-1-1 designation but I'd like to know if such a thing could be used and in which circumstances.</p>

							</div>

								
					
